        add("wiki.cyberneticenhancements.station.dropoff.operation", "Open the Quests tab and press Get Dropoff Point & Close to receive one free barrel and return to the world. Place it to register it and unlock that tab. If you lose the starter barrel, craft a replacement from a barrel, paper and an iron ingot. Your most recently placed or opened Dropoff Point receives future deliveries. Other players cannot open or register your barrel.");
        add("wiki.cyberneticenhancements.station.dropoff.rewards", "Turn in ready contracts from the Quests tab or over a call. Required quest items are taken from your inventory, while money, trust and XP are awarded immediately. Item rewards, including bonus schematics, arrive in your Dropoff Point within one Minecraft day. Turn in directly at the NPC to receive item rewards immediately instead.");
