        add("screen.cyberneticenhancements.npc.dialogue.fixer.line.root", "Need hardware? Chrome giving you grief? I can do both. And I know where a few relic caches are stashed.");
        add("screen.cyberneticenhancements.npc.dialogue.fixer.line.about", "I buy, I sell, I keep chromed-up folks standing when the strain gets heavy. Ask what you need and I'll name the price.");
        add("screen.cyberneticenhancements.npc.dialogue.fixer.line.work", "I move supplies and sell cache leads. A strain buffer buys you some relief. A neural reset clears psychosis and active doses. Neither fixes your cyberware, that's a Repair Station's job.");
        add("screen.cyberneticenhancements.npc.dialogue.fixer.line.advice", "Cache's easier to open when nobody's shooting at you. Clear the area, read the breach sequences, then start picking tokens.");
        add("screen.cyberneticenhancements.npc.dialogue.fixer.line.trust", "Pay up, play it straight, and we're good. Build some trust and you'll get better prices and the heavier services.");
        add("screen.cyberneticenhancements.npc.dialogue.fixer.line.terms", "Price is on the card before you pay. Neural reset needs more trust and runs once per world day. It also wipes suppression and RAM Jolt.");
        add("screen.cyberneticenhancements.npc.dialogue.fixer.player.shop", "Let me see what you\u0027re selling.");
